{"3851220": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Palland: Creature Tamer World", "steam_appid": 3851220, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you stepped onto the ancient marble circle, the ground vanished beneath your feet - and your story began.<br> The world of 🌌 <strong>Palland</strong> greeted you with glowing skies, endless meadows, and mysterious creatures known as <i>pakemons</i>. They look adorable by day... but when night falls, beauty turns to danger. Only those who understand them can survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources, craft weapons and armor, and build your shelter to endure the wilds. 🪓🔥 Tame powerful creatures to fight by your side - each one unique, with its own skills and personality. Some help you collect materials, others guard your camp or explore forgotten ruins hidden deep in the forest. 🐾</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But Palland is more than survival - it's a journey between worlds. 🌀 Ancient portals hide forgotten secrets, and lost civilizations whisper of a relic called the <i>Eye of Chaos</i>, capable of twisting the minds of creatures and men alike. Solve ancient puzzles, uncover hidden temples, and seek the rune stones that can open the path home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every step makes you stronger. Every loss teaches you something new. 💫 Beyond the darkness lies your final test - destroy the <i>Eye of Chaos</i> and restore balance to a world where even the wildest beings can show loyalty... and friendship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏕️ <strong>Palland: Creature Tamer World</strong> is an open-world survival adventure about taming, crafting, and discovering what it truly means to bring harmony to chaos. Build, explore, befriend - and find your way home. 🌿✨</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you stepped onto the ancient marble circle, the ground vanished beneath your feet - and your 